### ==========================================
### TEST IN4_ARDUINO - Lấy dữ liệu từ MongoDB
### ==========================================

### 1. Lấy tất cả dữ liệu (không giới hạn)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Lấy dữ liệu mới nhất theo email (CẦN JWT TOKEN)
# Thay YOUR_JWT_TOKEN bằng token thực từ login
# Thay YOUR_EMAIL bằng email thực của user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Lấy 360 bản ghi (1 giờ - 10s/record)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=360
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Lấy 2160 bản ghi (6 giờ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=2160
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Lấy 4320 bản ghi (12 giờ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=4320
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Lấy 8640 bản ghi (24 giờ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=8640
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Lấy 60480 bản ghi (7 ngày)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/YOUR_EMAIL/latest?limit=60480
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Tạo dữ liệu mới (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 28.5,
  "humidity": 65.2,
  "light": 450,
  "rainSensor": "yes",
  "rackStatus": "open",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 9. Upload dữ liệu (CẦN JWT TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/upload
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 30.0,
  "humidity": 70.0,
  "light": 500,
  "rainSensor": "no",
  "rackStatus": "close",
  "email": "YOUR_EMAIL"
}

### 10. Lấy 1 bản ghi theo ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/RECORD_ID
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Cập nhật bản ghi theo ID
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/RECORD_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 25.0,
  "rackStatus": "open"
}

### 12. Xóa bản ghi theo ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/in4-arduino/RECORD_ID
Content-Type: application/json